者符合重度抑郁障碍诊断，当前发作持续至少8周，基线MADRS总分≥26，且筛选前SSRI剂量稳定至少4周。排除标准包括双相障碍或精神病性障碍、近期有迫切自杀风险、当前物质使用障碍，以及研究者判断不适合参加。基线访视在筛选期完成后进行，采集MADRS总分，该评估由经培训且尽量保持同一的盲态评估者完成。","rationale":"已确认筛选期2周、入选标准（MDD诊断、当前发作至少8周、基线MADRS≥26、筛选前SSRI稳定至少4周）和排除标准（双相障碍或精神病性障碍、近期迫切自杀风险、当前物质使用障碍、研究者判断不适合参加），以及基线MADRS由盲态评估者完成。医学作者需核实筛选失败与重新筛选规则、基线评估项目清单及时间窗。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_6ef2ba74fc2f53d4","section_number":"7.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9d3d266bf1661bf0fa303343","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922164110_18eba586","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:9d3d266bf1661bf0fa303343","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_aaf66f9b9edb8722\n章节编号=7.1.2\n章节标题=治疗期及随访","quote_sha256":"4f13223cf7825667eccffa13549a50bea63562ea3011dc3afcab02547f9e53f3","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9d3d266bf1661bf0fa303343","span_id":"span_sec_712"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"试验干预：在既有稳定SSRI治疗基础上，试验组口服合成试验药C，对照组口服匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗8周。","quote_sha256":"9490d1e010dae104ee74c6848e871d1a15f0d0e32d1d652f6090003e48659d41","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药C：20 mg，每晚一次（口服）；8周\n合成试验药C匹配安慰剂：每晚一次（口服）；8周","quote_sha256":"91e5ece3510de35381cda11decb3caa95f2809d32a7c0504433360e287e47e46","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"剂量调整：不设置计划性剂量调整；因安全性需要的暂停或永久停药按方案停药标准处理。","quote_sha256":"c5ee